# Each venue ox can reach carries its own key variable. The pairing is
# deliberate: ox sends the key as a Bearer token to the venue's URL, so binding
# them together means asking for one venue cannot send another one's credential.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=op://YOUR_VAULT/Your OpenRouter Item/credential
ZENMUX_API_KEY=op://YOUR_VAULT/Your ZenMux PAYG Item/credential
OPENCODE_ZEN_API_KEY=op://YOUR_VAULT/Your OpenCode Zen Item/credential
REQUESTY_API_KEY=op://YOUR_VAULT/Your Requesty Item/credential
